Subject: [PATCH 1682/3799] soh: rename func_80ABA654 ->
 EnNiwLady_FinishCuccoTalk

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: once the counting line is advanced it hands over the bottle the first time all the Cuccos are penned, or a purple rupee afterwards, and otherwise returns to counting.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw_Lady/z_en_niw_lady.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
